# Environment variables (Supabase)

Create a .env.local file in your Next.js project root with the following keys (do NOT commit secrets):

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=your-supabase-url
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# OAuth
In Supabase Console → Authentication → Settings → External OAuth Providers, configure Google with redirect URL(s) including:

https://your-domain.com/api/auth/callback (or http://localhost:3000 if testing locally)
